Additional Use Grant: You may make production use of the Licensed Work provided that BOTH
                      of the following are true:
                        (a) in the most recent 12-month period, the total annual revenue of
                            You and your affiliates is less than USD 10,000,000 (ten million
                            US dollars) — self-attested; no audit is required; and
                        (b) You do not provide the Licensed Work, or any modified or
                            derivative version of it, to third parties as a hosted or managed
                            service, where that service gives users access to any substantial
                            set of the features or functionality of the Licensed Work.
                      Non-production use — including development, testing, research and
